size 16 16
// Pouncer Shell (Pouncer drop): its domed back plate, dark leaf-green chitin with banded segments and pale spots.
gradramp shell 9 #0c1a0c #16301a #224626 #305e30 #427838 #5a9444 #7cb05a #a8d07e
layer dome
key X #427838
grid 0 0
